+
+# arazzo
+
+Arazzo description and configuration.
+
+## Fields
+
+Field | Type | Description | Default
+:-- | :-- | :-- | :--
+name | string |  Required at the config level. Name of the Arazzo description, as defined in your configuration. | 
+descriptionPath | string |  Required at the config level. URL or local path to the Arazzo description. | 
+workflowId | string |  Optional. Only allowed at the test level. Unique identifier for the workflow to run. If not specified, runs the first workflow in the Arazzo description. | 
+inputs | object |  Optional. Only allowed at the test level. Input parameters for the Arazzo description. | 
+
+## Examples
+
+```json
+{
+  "descriptionPath": "https://example.com/arazzo.json"
+}
+```
+
+```json
+{
+  "name": "CreateUser",
+  "descriptionPath": "https://www.acme.com/create-user.arazzo.json",
+  "inputs": {
+    "name": "John Doe",
+    "email": "johndoe@acme.com"
+  }
+}
+```
